<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Palmer, 360 started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Palmer, 360 started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said its analyst Walt Piecyk started coverage of Palmer Wireless Inc with a buy and 360 Communications Co with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Palmer shares rose 5/8 to 15-3/4.</p>
<p>-- 360 shares were flat at 24.</p>
</text>
